- tools: prof.py (names 1 kHz profiler samples), cmp_trace.py (first differing tick), debug_run.sh/shot_at.sh
  use NAME from port.conf, vhost.c handles unattached sprites, make_assets.sh accepts AxROM + CHR RAM
